.TH COLOR 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
Color \- An RGBA color with 8\-bit channels, 0..255 each
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtypes.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef SDL_Color   Color;     /* { uint8_t r, g, b, a } */
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
An RGBA color with 8\-bit channels, 0..255 each. Alpha 255 is opaque, 0 is invisible; every draw call blends, so alpha between the two is translucent. Build one with rgb(), rgba() or a COLOR_* constant. A Color whose alpha is 0 is treated as "unset" by several modules (EngineConfig.clear_color, Menu.color), which then substitute a default.
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B r
red, 0..255
.TP
.B g
green, 0..255
.TP
.B b
blue, 0..255
.TP
.B a
alpha (opacity), 0..255
.SH MODULE
types (src/engine/types/types.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rgb (3),
.BR rgba (3),
.BR draw_rect (3),
.BR gge\-types (7),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
